@startuml NetSentinel_Architecture
!theme plain
skinparam componentStyle uml2

title NetSentinel — Arquitetura do Sistema (Big Picture)

actor "Usuário / CLI" as User

node "Servidor do NetSentinel (Java App)" {
    package "Camada REST (Controllers)" {
        [TargetController\n(/api/v1/targets)] as TargetCtrl
        [CheckController\n(/api/v1/checks)] as CheckCtrl
    }

    package "Gerenciador de Agendamento" {
        [ScheduledExecutorService\n(Thread Pool)] as Scheduler
    }

    package "Motor de Diagnóstico (Service)" {
        [PING Engine\n(InetAddress)] as PingEng
        [TCP Engine\n(Socket)] as TcpEng
        [HTTP Engine\n(HttpClient)] as HttpEng
    }

    package "Armazenamento & Métricas" {
        [Memória / Banco de Dados] as Storage
        [Micrometer / Metrics Registry\n(/metrics)] as Metrics
    }
}

node "Infraestrutura Alvo" {
    [Gateways / Routers\n(ICMP/PING)] as TargetPing
    [PostgreSQL / Redis\n(TCP Sockets)] as TargetTcp
    [APIs Web / Nginx\n(HTTP/HTTPS)] as TargetHttp
}

node "Observabilidade Externa" {
    [Prometheus] as Prometheus
}

' Fluxo de interações
User --> TargetCtrl : 1. Configura Targets (POST/PUT/DELETE)
User --> CheckCtrl : Consultas de Status & Testes sob demanda

TargetCtrl --> Scheduler : Agenda tarefas periódicas
CheckCtrl --> Storage : Consulta histórico e status atual

Scheduler --> PingEng : 2. Dispara checagem em Threads
Scheduler --> TcpEng : 2. Dispara checagem em Threads
Scheduler --> HttpEng : 2. Dispara checagem em Threads

PingEng --> TargetPing : 3. Valida L3 (ICMP)
TcpEng --> TargetTcp : 3. Valida L4 (TCP Handshake)
HttpEng --> TargetHttp : 3. Valida L7 (GET/HEAD Request)

PingEng --> Storage : 4. Salva Latência & Status (UP/DOWN)
TcpEng --> Storage : 4. Salva Latência & Status (UP/DOWN)
HttpEng --> Storage : 4. Salva Latência & Status (UP/DOWN)

PingEng --> Metrics : Atualiza Métricas
TcpEng --> Metrics : Atualiza Métricas
HttpEng --> Metrics : Atualiza Métricas

Prometheus --> Metrics : 5. Scrape de Métricas (/metrics)

@enduml